  "literals": [],
  "text": "Monty Tech is the regional vocational high school Lunenburg belongs to. Lunenburg’s bill was $1,334,521, most of it a minimum the state sets; the school spent $25,827 a pupil in FY2025, less than most vocational districts."
 },
 "blocks": [
