   "block": "explain",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "figures": {},
     "literals": [
      "1964",
      "8"
     ],
     "text": "**1964.** The Annual Town Meeting created a three-member Regional Vocational School District Planning Committee (Article 8)."
    },
    {
     "figures": {},
     "literals": [
      "November 2, 1965",
      "Chapter 568 of the Acts of 1964",
      "Chapter 543 of the Acts of 1965",
      "AFFIRMATIVE-212 NEGATIVE-1"
     ],
     "text": "**November 2, 1965.** A Special Town Meeting was asked: *“Shall the town accept the provisions of Chapter 568 of the Acts of 1964, as amended by Chapter 543 of the Acts of 1965, providing for the establishment of a regional school district”* The record: *“VOTED. AFFIRMATIVE-212 NEGATIVE-1”*"
    },
    {
     "figures": {},
     "literals": [
      "March 5, 1966",
      "15",
      "$1,863.98"
     ],
     "text": "**March 5, 1966.** The first appropriation for the district’s expenses, Article 15: *“VOTED UNANIMOUSLY TO RAISE BY TAXATION AND APPROPRIATE $1,863.98.”*"
    },
    {
     "figures": {},
     "literals": [
      "1967",
      "June 12, 1967"
     ],
     "text": "It was first named the Northern Worcester County Regional Vocational-Technical School District. The 1967 report: *“The formation of the Montachusett Regional-Vocational Technical School District was validated by an act of Legislation and signed by Governor Volpe on June 12, 1967.”*"
    }
   ],
